@startuml sequence-staff-intake
title Sequence Diagram(Staff Intake And Shelving)
actor Staff
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "Parcel API" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

Staff -> UI : scan the waybill and enter the size
UI -> API : POST /locations/recommend (size)
API -> DB : find a free location of that size
alt no location is free
  API --> UI : 200 recommendedLocation = null, reason = no_location_available
  UI --> Staff : ask for a location to be chosen by hand
else a location is free
  API --> UI : 200 recommendedLocation
  UI --> Staff : show the suggestion, which may be ignored
end
Staff -> UI : accept the suggestion or choose another location
UI -> API : POST /parcels (trackingNo, carrier, size, locationId)
API -> DB : find parcel by trackingNo
alt duplicate waybill
  API --> UI : 409 Conflict
  UI --> Staff : Parcel already registered
else new parcel
  API -> DB : insert parcel (transaction)
  DB --> API : parcel id
  API --> UI : 201 Parcel
  UI --> Staff : show the parcel and its location
end
@enduml